    "title": "Cumbal (Nariño) living landscape boundary",
    "description": "Canonical MOSAIC delineation of the Cumbal (Nariño) living landscape (COL-CUM), used to define the landscape across the catalogue. Source: Nine veredas of the Cumbal indigenous reserve area (Tasmag, Quilismal, Boyera, Cuaical, Cuaspud Grande, Llano de Piedras, Cuetial, Guan, San Martin-Miraflores), layer 'Cumbal_veredas_wgs84' compiled by Javier Ochoa (CIP). Original source to be confirmed. Full-detail Shapefile and GeoPackage in the dated release boundaries-2026-10-14 of MOSAIC-mfl/catalog; a simplified outline is attached to the landscape's STAC collection.",
